+++| ruff 的抑制寫法 | `noqa` 不分大小寫、`#` 後可有空白;檔案層級用 `# ruff: noqa` 或 `# flake8: noqa`;另有 `ruff: ignore`、`ruff: file-ignore`、`ruff: disable` 註解,2026-11-09 讀 | https://docs.astral.sh/ruff/linter/#error-suppression |
